    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness Takeover is a short psychological horror game that places you in the mind of Karim a man trapped inside a haunted maze, pursued by an unrelenting force known as The Stalker Master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to explore, survive, and find the key that opens the final door. But beware: A corpse should be left well alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring eerie sound design, immersive darkness, and a haunting original story, Darkness Takeover is a free indie horror experience built with love by solo developer Hussain Alhumaidi.</p>",
